s://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/8177#issuecomment-180219160","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/8177","id":180219160,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE4MDIxOTE2MA==","user":{"login":"smetje","id":17066448,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDY2NDQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17066448?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje","html_url":"https://github.com/smetje","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-02-05T06:28:08Z","updated_at":"2016-02-05T06:28:08Z","body":"Correct sorting on the choosen key, like this for descending:\n`\nArray\n(\n\n```\n[0] => Array\n    (\n        [id] => 4\n        [title] => element 4\n        [extra] => 4\n    )\n\n[1] => Array\n    (\n        [id] => 2\n        [title] => element 2\n        [extra] => 2\n    )\n\n[2] => Array\n    (\n        [id] => 1\n        [title] => element 1\n        [extra] => 1\n    )\n\n[3] => Array\n    (\n        [id] => 3\n        [title] => element 3\n    )\n```\n\n)\n`\nHere it was sorted on the 'extra' key with values descending. Elements without the 'extra' key have a 'null' value, so they were added at the bottom. For Ascending directions the elements without the 'extra' key would be the first after sorting.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/180219160/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"smetje","id":17066448,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDY2NDQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17066448?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje","html_url":"https://github.com/smetje","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/180220467","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/8177#issuecomment-180220467","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/8177","id":180220467,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE4MDIyMDQ2Nw==","user":{"login":"smetje","id":17066448,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDY2NDQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17066448?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje","html_url":"https://github.com/smetje","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-02-05T06:30:30Z","updated_at":"2016-02-05T06:31:42Z","body":"In my project I only need the sorting for arrays with numeric keys, so this is how I have fixed it, until a better solution is presented:\n\n``` PHP\n// Make sortValues match the data length, as some keys could be missing\n// the sorted value path.\nif ($sortCount < $dataCount) {\n    if ($numeric) {\n        $sortValues = array();\n        foreach($data as $key=>$value) {\n            $extracted = self::extract($value, substr($path, 4));//Remove first {n}. from path, this can only with numeric keys\n            if (!empty($extracted)) {\n                $extracted = $extracted[0];\n            } else {\n                $extracted = null;\n            }\n            $sortValues[$key] = $extracted; \n        }\n    } else {\n        $sortValues = array_pad($sortValues, $dataCount, null);\n    }\n}\n```\n\nIts not the best solution, but it fixes my problem and I can finish my project.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/180220467/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"smetje","id":17066448,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDY2NDQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17066448?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje","html_url":"https://github.com/smetje","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smetje/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gi